  "notes": "{会合|かいごう} refers to gatherings or meetings, often more formal than casual get-togethers.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {会合|かいごう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {会合|かいごう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{開|ひら}く→開く：01979_hiraku⟧ (to hold a meeting)\n- {会合|かいごう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{出席|しゅっせき}する→出席：02084_shusseki⟧ (to attend a meeting)\n- {会合|かいごう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{設|もう}ける→設ける：14220_moukeru⟧ (to arrange a meeting)\n\nTYPES:\n- ⟦{定期|ていき}→定期：03538_teiki⟧{会合|かいごう} (regular meeting)\n- ⟦{緊急|きんきゅう}→緊急：11327_kinkyuu⟧{会合|かいごう} (emergency meeting)\n- ⟦{秘密|ひみつ}→秘密：02504_himitsu⟧{会合|かいごう} (secret meeting)\n\nUSAGE:\n- More formal than ⟦{集|あつ}まり→集まり：01689_atsumari⟧ (gathering)\n- Less formal than ⟦{会議|かいぎ}→会議：00710_kaigi⟧ (conference)\n- Often implies a purpose or agenda\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{会議|かいぎ}→会議：00710_kaigi⟧: meeting, conference (business)\n- ⟦{集会|しゅうかい}→集会：14654_shuukai⟧: assembly, gathering\n- ⟦{集|あつ}まり→集まり：01689_atsumari⟧: gathering (casual)",
